              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisikieni neno hili, enyi ng'ombe wa Bashani, mnaokaa juu ya mlima wa Samaria, mnaowaonea maskini, na kuwaponda wahitaji; mnaowaambia bwana zao, Haya! Leteni, tunywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwana MUNGU ameapa kwa utakatifu wake, ya kuwa, tazama, siku zitawajia, watakapowaondoa ninyi kwa kulabu, na mabaki yenu kwa ndoana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanyi mtatoka kwenye mahali palipobomolewa, kila mwanamke moja kwa moja mbele yake; nanyi mtajitupa katika Harmoni, asema BWANA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
