        {
          "text": " Baadhi yenu nimewaangamiza, kama hapo Mungu alipoiangamiza Sodoma na Gomora, nanyi mkawa kama kinga kilichonyakuliwa motoni; lakini hamkunirudia mimi, asema BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
